        "slc_c00c276a5d282249af387516fccc6f5403b348baa28e70866416b7f6200bbb81"
      ],
      "text": "Tig is described as an autonomous AI coding agent that runs in the terminal, comparable to Claude Code and OpenAI Codex but supporting more LLMs."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_399928b6fa686a1f334fd141b4ac87ed933874f4852a645f7046c54d59869faa",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8",
          "git_sha": "00b9b723d7b4d62d3a1a49a26c4e369438b0ad02",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 4,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rsrohan99/tig",
          "url": "https://github.com/rsrohan99/tig/blob/3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8/README.md#L4-L9"
        },
        {
          "commit": "3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8",
          "git_sha": "00b9b723d7b4d62d3a1a49a26c4e369438b0ad02",
          "line_end": 11,
          "line_start": 11,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rsrohan99/tig",
          "url": "https://github.com/rsrohan99/tig/blob/3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8/README.md#L11-L11"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_005e1a1d73b8ef30fca020077ca365a4d5d4a1faca8b3a56b37d137ef3e5f450",
        "slc_b50e3a432d309cdb654efba23e1244d7e6c00399cd58b12301eb27bf1f2a28d5"
      ],
      "text": "The agent can write code, fix bugs, execute shell commands, write tests, and analyze a codebase, all within the terminal."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8e8a405f9ca3d8568fd4bb348b0946c5f1ae032ef75fb02c35d8b064b1ca8b05",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8",
          "git_sha": "00b9b723d7b4d62d3a1a49a26c4e369438b0ad02",
          "line_end": 21,
          "line_start": 19,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rsrohan99/tig",
          "url": "https://github.com/rsrohan99/tig/blob/3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8/README.md#L19-L21"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9e66339bb387806cc8150a7795fb0133ff32eb29c44588d1e9bd429c2419792f"
      ],
      "text": "Tig offers task modes: an Architect mode that designs systems and saves designs to a markdown file, and a Code mode that implements the architect's plan step by step."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ae4bcf922f5e37a2ef0bea586f175f7bf7add26e6c13afc06f54760c8af663ed",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8",
          "git_sha": "00b9b723d7b4d62d3a1a49a26c4e369438b0ad02",
          "line_end": 30,
          "line_start": 23,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rsrohan99/tig",
          "url": "https://github.com/rsrohan99/tig/blob/3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8/README.md#L23-L30"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a884780cf7688d09e02bc5fee062ada8168d547e01d4c3c9d6ea9ac376fc7888"
      ],
      "text": "Supported LLM providers include Google Gemini, OpenAI, Claude, OpenRouter, Deepseek, Groq, and local models via Ollama."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_ee61f2a2f45d79041ef15196f6088a9e103a38871fb9e25de82cc1c08cad9f78",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8",
          "git_sha": "00b9b723d7b4d62d3a1a49a26c4e369438b0ad02",
          "line_end": 38,
          "line_start": 35,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "rsrohan99/tig",
          "url": "https://github.com/rsrohan99/tig/blob/3df12189c01e2674991bc998404af7217ae5b9d8/README.md#L35-L38"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_9d3f32e4923a63a454dd661b5b196f7f32a2b65b04caa7a93affb2d181eaebc0"
      ],
      "text": "The toolchain uses LlamaIndex Workflows for orchestration and multi-LLM support, Tree-sitter for code-definition search and syntax-error checking, Ripgrep for regex search, and diff-match-patch for displaying diffs."
    },
    {
