        "slc_c977d7b0329d4b54f85dddf8ff7dc64118139c2c32d832fe65bec69e10076313"
      ],
      "text": "Ripgrep is listed as an external tool Tig depends on, with per-OS install instructions (Homebrew on macOS, pacman on Arch, dnf on Fedora)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_57924eb2a964f8b30b16883683ae0766eaad0101bfb6fcb9dd247153518924a0",
