        "slc_e80f36a43ce47c6a48975e4ea24873ba494eba473891ae712ac922f6c2af4505"
      ],
      "text": "Tig is installed via pip as the tig-code package and run with the tig command, optionally with a --mode flag choosing code or architect."
    },
