        "slc_f63c5814b6f684a8aa55cbd9d98f6cc30ea16c77bca9fbf6c37eba0cf9fc3aa3"
      ],
      "text": "Configuration is done through a .env file specifying the provider (google, openai, anthropic, deepseek, groq, ollama, openrouter), model (e.g. TIG_MODEL), and the matching provider API key."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
